WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.339
Adverbs such as yesterday and nearby describe the time or place of actions.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:08.656
Which word tells when an action happened? Answer: yesterday

00:00:09.533 --> 00:00:12.947
Use four different adverbs to make a travel account more precise.

00:00:13.783 --> 00:00:16.557
Discuss why: Yesterday is an adverb of time.
